<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">上學期回顧 · 弱點診斷 · 寒假備戰規劃 · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>本堂定位：</b>反思與規劃課（非一般操題課）<br/>
<b>涵蓋範圍：</b>全上學期 L01-L19（20堂精華回顧）<br/>
<b>核心目標：</b>診斷個人弱點 · 制定寒假 SSPA 備戰計劃 · 建立Trap意識<br/>
<b>輸出成果：</b>個人弱點分析報告 · 寒假每週溫習計劃 · SSPA 目標設定<br/>
<b>SSPA 倒數：</b>寒假後即進入下學期 SSPA 衝刺階段
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
<span>SSPA目標Fraction：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- ══════ PAGE 2: UPPER SEMESTER TOPIC SUMMARY ══════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、上學期課程全景回顧（L01-L19）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">二十堂內容總覽</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 SSPA衝刺·限時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">模擬真實SSPA考試！限時作答，每題計分。答對率達80%解鎖「SSPA戰士」勳章！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⚡ 開始模擬考 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt" style="font-size:11px;">
<tr><th style="width:36px;">堂</th><th>課題</th><th>核心概念</th><th>SSPA 比重</th></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L01</td><td>DecimalDivision</td><td>Decimal點移動法則、商的Decimal位</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">中</span> ~8%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L02</td><td>FractionDecimal百Fraction互換</td><td>三種形式互換、Fraction轉百Fraction</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高</span> ~12%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L03</td><td>綜合應用</td><td>跨形式計算、折扣、比較大小</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高</span> ~10%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L04</td><td>百Fraction佔比求原值</td><td>已知部分求全體、逆向百Fraction</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高</span> ~12%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L05</td><td>百Fraction增減連續變化</td><td>基準量轉移、先加後減Trap</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高</span> ~12%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L06</td><td>Circle的認識</td><td>半徑直徑關係、Circle規使用</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">中</span> ~6%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L07</td><td>Circle周長</td><td>C=πd=2πr、π取值選擇</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高</span> ~10%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L08</td><td>CircleArea</td><td>A=πr²、半Circle/扇形Area</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高</span> ~10%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L09</td><td>Area綜合</td><td>複合圖形Area、分割組合</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">中</span> ~8%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L10</td><td>Volume入門</td><td>長方體/正方體Volume、單位換算</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">中</span> ~6%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L11</td><td>Average/Mean</td><td>總和÷數量、加權平均</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">中</span> ~8%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L12</td><td>Speed/Rate（一）</td><td>S=D/T、單位轉換、相遇問題</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高</span> ~10%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L13</td><td>Speed/Rate（二）</td><td>平均Speed/Rate、追及問題</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">中</span> ~6%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L14</td><td>折線圖</td><td>製作與閱讀、趨勢分析</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">中</span> ~6%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L15</td><td>SSPA模擬2</td><td>期中模擬考試</td><td>—</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L16</td><td>容量與Volume進階</td><td>排水法、溢出、多重物體</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高</span> ~10%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L17</td><td>Circle形圖閱讀+製作</td><td>餅圖、百分比轉角度</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">中</span> ~8%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L18</td><td>綜合圖表幾何測量</td><td>跨課題整合、設計測量呈現</td><td><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">高</span> ~10%</td></tr>
<tr><td style="text-align:center;font-weight:700;">L19</td><td>SSPA模擬3</td><td>期末模擬考試（100分全卷）</td><td>—</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、快速公式參考表（上學期精華版）</div>
<div class="formula-grid">
<div class="formula-card">
<div class="topic">Circle形</div>
<div class="name">Circle周長</div>
<div class="formula">C = πd = 2πr</div>
<div class="lf-note">π ≈ 3.14 或 <span class="f"><span class="n">22</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span></div>
</div>
<div class="formula-card">
<div class="topic">Circle形</div>
<div class="name">CircleArea</div>
<div class="formula">A = πr²</div>
<div class="lf-note">半CircleArea = πr² ÷ 2</div>
</div>
<div class="formula-card">
<div class="topic">Triangle</div>
<div class="name">TriangleArea</div>
<div class="formula">A = <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> bh</div>
<div class="lf-note">不要忘記除 2！</div>
</div>
<div class="formula-card">
<div class="topic">Trapezoid</div>
<div class="name">TrapezoidArea</div>
<div class="formula">A = <span class="f"><span class="n">(a+b)h</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span></div>
<div class="lf-note">(上底+下底)×高÷2</div>
</div>
<div class="formula-card">
<div class="topic">Volume</div>
<div class="name">長方體Volume</div>
<div class="formula">V = l × w × h</div>
<div class="lf-note">1 m³ = 1000 L</div>
</div>
<div class="formula-card">
<div class="topic">排水法</div>
<div class="name">物體Volume</div>
<div class="formula">V<sub>物</sub> = A<sub>底</sub> × Δh</div>
<div class="lf-note">用高度差，非新水深</div>
</div>
<div class="formula-card">
<div class="topic">Speed/Rate</div>
<div class="name">基本Speed/Rate公式</div>
<div class="formula">S = <span class="f"><span class="n">D</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">T</span></span></div>
<div class="lf-note">單位要一致</div>
</div>
<div class="formula-card">
<div class="topic">Average/Mean</div>
<div class="name">Average/Mean公式</div>
<div class="formula">平均 = <span class="f"><span class="n">總和</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">數量</span></span></div>
<div class="lf-note">中位數要先排序</div>
</div>
<div class="formula-card">
<div class="topic">百Fraction</div>
<div class="name">增減公式</div>
<div class="formula">新值 = 原值×(1±r%)</div>
<div class="lf-note">連續變化逐次乘</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">記住：「公式是工具，Trap是敵人。識破Trap比背熟公式更重要。」</div>
</div>
<!-- ══════ PAGE 3: TRAP CHECKLIST + SELF-DIAGNOSIS ══════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Trap自查清單 — 十大Trap類型（T1-T10）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">請在每個Trap旁自我評分（1=完全不會，2=有時犯，3=經常犯，4=每次都中招）</div>
<table class="checklist">
<tr><th class="trap-col">Trap編號</th><th>Trap描述</th><th class="check-col">自評<br/>(1-4)</th><th class="action-col">行動計劃（寫下你打算如何克服）</th></tr>
<tr><td class="trap-col" style="background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;">T1</td><td><strong>DecimalDivisionDecimal點錯位：</strong>除數是Decimal時忘記移位或被除數移位不一致</td><td class="check-col"><span class="lf-ans" style="min-height:30px;display:block;"></span></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="trap-col" style="background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;">T2</td><td><strong>Fraction/Decimal/百Fraction互換錯誤：</strong>忘記通分、百Fraction轉Decimal少除100</td><td class="check-col"><span class="lf-ans" style="min-height:30px;display:block;"></span></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="trap-col" style="background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;">T3</td><td><strong>百Fraction佔比求原值方向錯誤：</strong>應除卻乘、應乘卻除</td><td class="check-col"><span class="lf-ans" style="min-height:30px;display:block;"></span></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="trap-col" style="background:#FEE2E2;color:#991B1B;">T4</td><td><strong>百Fraction連續變化基準量轉移：</strong>先加r%再減r% = 沒變？（Trap！）</td><td class="check-col"><span class="lf-ans" style="min-height:30px;display:block;"></span></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="trap-col" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">T5</td><td><strong>Circle周長 vs CircleArea混淆：</strong>用錯公式（C vs A）</td><td class="check-col"><span class="lf-ans" style="min-height:30px;display:block;"></span></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="trap-col" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">T6</td><td><strong>Triangle/TrapezoidArea忘記除2：</strong>直接底乘高當Area</td><td class="check-col"><span class="lf-ans" style="min-height:30px;display:block;"></span></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="trap-col" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">T7</td><td><strong>Speed/Rate公式方向用反：</strong>S=D/T、D=S×T、T=D/S 三者搞亂</td><td class="check-col"><span class="lf-ans" style="min-height:30px;display:block;"></span></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="trap-col" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">T8</td><td><strong>排水法用水面新高度：</strong>錯誤地用新水面高度乘底Area</td><td class="check-col"><span class="lf-ans" style="min-height:30px;display:block;"></span></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="trap-col" style="background:#F3E8FF;color:#7C3AED;">T9</td><td><strong>Circle形圖百分比不驗證：</strong>不加總檢查，總和可能不足100%</td><td class="check-col"><span class="lf-ans" style="min-height:30px;display:block;"></span></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="trap-col" style="background:#F3E8FF;color:#7C3AED;">T10</td><td><strong>跨課題Question公式混用：</strong>圖表數據未統一單位、複合圖分錯</td><td class="check-col"><span class="lf-ans" style="min-height:30px;display:block;"></span></td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">四、個人弱點診斷表</div>
<div class="template-box">
<div class="tpl-title">根據上面Trap自查清單和 L19 模擬考結果，填寫你的個人弱點分析</div>
<table class="lf-qt" style="font-size:11px;">
<tr><th>診斷項目</th><th>你的分析（具體描述）</th></tr>
<tr><td><strong>最強的3個課題</strong>（得分率&gt;85%）</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>最弱的3個課題</strong>（得分率&lt;60%）</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>最常犯的3個Trap</strong>（自評3或4分）</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>失分最多的題型</strong>（MC/計算/應用？）</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>時間管理情況</strong>（夠時間完成嗎？哪部分最花時間？）</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>粗心失分</strong>（有幾多分是因為粗心而唔係唔識？）</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div class="mn">Mnemonic：「知己知彼，百戰百勝。知道自己的弱點，就是進步的第一步。」</div>
</div>
