<!-- ══════ PAGE 5: PRACTICE + ERROR TABLE ══════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">七、精簡複習練習（共 12 題，涵蓋上學期各範疇）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">範疇一：DecimalDivision + Fraction百Fraction互換（題1-3）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>4.8 ÷ 0.16 = ？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>將 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> 轉為百Fraction。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>$200 的 35% 是多少？$200 增加了 35% 後是多少？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">範疇二：Circle形（題4-6）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>Circle的半徑是 10 cm。求Circle周長和CircleArea。（π 取 3.14）</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>一個半Circle的直徑是 14 cm。求其Perimeter和Area。（π ≈ <span class="f"><span class="n">22</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">7</span></span>）</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>一個Circle形花園的半徑增加了 20%。新Area是原Area的多少倍？增加了百分之幾？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">範疇三：Average/Mean + Speed/Rate（題7-9）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>五個數字：18, 24, 30, x, 42。若Average/Mean是 30，求 x。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>汽車以 80 km/h 行駛 2.5 小時。行駛了多少公里？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>小明去程Speed/Rate 6 km/h，回程Speed/Rate 4 km/h（同一路線）。求全程的平均Speed/Rate。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">範疇四：Volume排水法 + 圖表（題10-12）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>水箱底Area 300 cm²，放入石頭後水面由 12 cm 升至 17 cm。石頭Volume是多少？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>Circle形圖中A佔 35%，B佔 25%，C佔 40%。全體總數為 200。C 類別的數量是多少？C 對應的Circle心角是多少度？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>一件貨品先加價 15%，再以八五折出售。原價 $600。最終售價是多少？與原價相比是高了還是低了？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">八、寒假衝刺加強練習（附錄 34 題）</div>
<div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:8px;padding:6px 12px;background:#FEF2F2;border-radius:4px;">
    以下按上學期課題分類，用於寒假每週練習。先做最弱課題！
  </div>
<div class="lf-h2">A. DecimalDivision + Fraction百Fraction互換（S1-S8）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S1</td><td>計算 7.2 ÷ 0.09。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S2</td><td>計算 5.6 ÷ 0.04 + 3.5 × 2.8。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S3</td><td>把 <span class="f"><span class="n">7</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span> 化為Decimal（準確至三位Decimal）和百Fraction。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S4</td><td>把 87.5% 化為最簡Fraction。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S5</td><td>計算 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> − <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span>，答案化為帶Fraction。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S6</td><td>比較大小：<span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> ____ 0.67（填 &gt;、&lt; 或 =）</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S7</td><td>計算 <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> × 3.2 ÷ <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S8</td><td>某數的 37.5% 是 60，求該數。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">B. 百Fraction應用（S9-S15）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S9</td><td>$240 的 45% 是多少？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S10</td><td>一件貨品原價 $500，先加價 20% 再打七五折。最終售價多少？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S11</td><td>存款 $12000，年利率 3.5%，存滿兩年的單利是多少？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S12</td><td>A 校有男生 280 人，女生 220 人。男生佔全校百分之幾？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S13</td><td>某商品先加價 30%，再減價 30%。最終價格與原價相比是加了還是減了？相差百分之幾？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S14</td><td>小華買了一件貨品，以八折購入後以標價的 90% 轉售。若轉售價為 $648，標價原是多少？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S15</td><td>班中 60% 學生及格，不及格有 16 人。全班多少人？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div class="pb page-break">
<div class="lf-h2">C. Circle形（S16-S21）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S16</td><td>Circle形直徑 28 cm，取 π = 22/7。求（a）Perimeter（b）Area。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S17</td><td>Circle形半徑 5 cm，取 π = 3.14。求Area。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S18</td><td>一個半Circle的半徑 14 cm，取 π = 22/7。求半Circle的Perimeter和Area。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S19</td><td>一個Circle環，外Circle半徑 10 cm，內Circle半徑 6 cm。取 π = 3.14，求Circle環Area。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S20</td><td>Circle形水池直徑 6 m。在水池外圍鋪一條闊 1 m 的石路。取 π = 3.14，求石路Area。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S21</td><td>Circle的Perimeter是 88 cm，取 π = 22/7。求直徑和Area。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">D. Volume排水法 + Average/Mean + Speed/Rate（S22-S28）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S22</td><td>長方體水箱底面長 25 cm、闊 12 cm。水深 10 cm。放入石頭後水位升至 16 cm。求石頭Volume。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S23</td><td>水箱底Area 400 cm²，原有水深 15 cm。放入 3 個完全相同的鐵球後水位升至 19.5 cm。每個鐵球Volume多少？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S24</td><td>六次考試成績：72, 85, 68, 91, 78, x。Average/Mean是 80，求 x。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S25</td><td>八個數的Average/Mean是 52，去掉最大的數後Average/Mean變成 48。最大的數是多少？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S26</td><td>汽車以 72 km/h 行駛 45 min。行了多少 km？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#FEF3C7;color:#92400E;">基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S27</td><td>甲乙相距 360 km。甲車Speed/Rate 70 km/h，乙車Speed/Rate 50 km/h，相向而行。幾小時後相遇？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S28</td><td>去程Speed/Rate 60 km/h，回程Speed/Rate 40 km/h（同一路線）。求全程平均Speed/Rate。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">E. Circle形圖 + 綜合應用（S29-S34）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S29</td><td>Circle形圖中 A 佔 30%，B 佔 45%，C 佔 25%。全體 400 人。B 有多少人？B 的Circle心角是多少度？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S30</td><td>Circle形圖中四個部分的角度分別是 90°、120°、80°、70°。哪個部分佔最多？佔百分之幾？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S31</td><td>小明中文得 80 分，數學比中文高 15%，英文比數學低 10%。英文多少分？三科平均多少分？</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S32</td><td>Rectangle長 20 cm、闊 12 cm。在Rectangle內剪去一個最大的Circle。求剩餘Area。（π = 3.14）</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S33</td><td>甲車先以 90 km/h 行了 1 小時，再以 60 km/h 行了 2 小時。求總距離和全程平均Speed/Rate。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DCFCE7;color:#166534;">進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">S34</td><td>正方體容器邊長 10 cm，注入水深 7 cm。放入一個邊長 5 cm 的正方體鐵塊（完全浸沒）。求新水深。</td><td class="lf-qd" style="background:#DBEAFE;color:#1E40AF;">挑戰</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:65px;"></td></tr>
</table>
